{"1926880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crabs: Chef's Story", "steam_appid": 1926880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to &quot;House of Crab.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crabs: Chef's Story</strong> is a 2–8 player PvP brawler that plays like a couch party game, but is built for online or LAN play. Grab your crew, pick your crab, and brawl across a kitchen full of deadly hazards in quick 2–7 minute rounds. Best with friends, open to anyone. Easy to pick up, packed with chaos, and built for the kind of moments you'll be clipping for weeks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/9099399f6e1ff1332e6ef1c7a45978ed.poster.avif?t=1787652860\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/9099399f6e1ff1332e6ef1c7a45978ed.webm?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/9099399f6e1ff1332e6ef1c7a45978ed.mp4?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🥊 <strong>MASTER 'CRAB-FU'</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A full brawler moveset, jab, uppercut, dash, flip, ground pound, grab and throw</strong>. This isn't floppy-physics flailing: it's rock-paper-scissors with claws. Dizzy an opponent by blocking his charging dash, break blocks with a well timed uppercut, and dodge attacks to turn the tables. Read your opponent, time your attacks, and you'll be cracking shells while your friends are still finding the buttons. Easy to learn, with real depth to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/beaf7fb12bef3cc433ed7222416d7941.poster.avif?t=1787652860\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/beaf7fb12bef3cc433ed7222416d7941.webm?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/beaf7fb12bef3cc433ed7222416d7941.mp4?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🦀 <strong>NAVIGATE WITH 'PARK-CLAW'</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump, climb, swim and scuttle</strong> your way to victory. Scuttling at top speed recharges <strong>'Crab-Zen'</strong>, for special moves, unleash dashes, counters and ground-pounds to crush your rivals. Stay still and you're a sitting target, keep up the pace and become a crustacean crushing menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/ccebdfa57a046f6d489dd50569efa892.poster.avif?t=1787652860\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/ccebdfa57a046f6d489dd50569efa892.webm?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/ccebdfa57a046f6d489dd50569efa892.mp4?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔪 <strong>SURVIVE THE KITCHEN COLOSSEUM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the kitchen, weaponise it, survive it.</strong> Ride extractor fans to reach high ground, but stay clear of the blades. Pelt rivals with tin cans, fruit and veg for one-hit kills, or bounce them on jellies into the chaos. Dodge flying cleavers, rolling pins and knives. Don't get cooked in the soup or set ablaze on the hobs. Use the kitchen, or the kitchen uses you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/28f9ae906e33ec9bbc3cc4bce5d88c37.poster.avif?t=1787652860\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/28f9ae906e33ec9bbc3cc4bce5d88c37.webm?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/28f9ae906e33ec9bbc3cc4bce5d88c37.mp4?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 <strong>BATTLE MODE — AND MORE TO COME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crabs launches with Battle Mode</strong>, a sumo-style free-for-all. Most kills wins. The kitchen floor is death, so stay on the counters and smash your friends off the edge! Customise the rules to play your way. <strong>Battle Mode is just the start, Early Access grows with new game modes</strong>, kitchen arenas and chaos as the community plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/1c9543d7e2a6d72f9e6b34b0ddf3864d.poster.avif?t=1787652860\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/1c9543d7e2a6d72f9e6b34b0ddf3864d.webm?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/1c9543d7e2a6d72f9e6b34b0ddf3864d.mp4?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ <strong>UNLEASH INSANE POWER-UPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt down power-ups</strong> before your opponents do. Fire Fruit Cannons, hulk out, and throw bombs! One power-up can flip an entire match. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/aa8c1c7832a4359863c63952c9a23f1a.poster.avif?t=1787652860\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/aa8c1c7832a4359863c63952c9a23f1a.webm?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/aa8c1c7832a4359863c63952c9a23f1a.mp4?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👕 <strong>'CRUSTOMISE' YOUR CRAB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your own 'Crabtastic' character</strong>, mix and match skins and apparel across 8 slots to. Knock costume pieces off your opponents mid-match and steal their look, collect a full set and transform. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/d11391e2a4e3c76b71da6c5d11a6413c.poster.avif?t=1787652860\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/d11391e2a4e3c76b71da6c5d11a6413c.webm?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/d11391e2a4e3c76b71da6c5d11a6413c.mp4?t=1787652860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 <strong>ONLINE &amp; LAN MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crabs is built for playing together.</strong> Get 2–8 friends into a lobby online or over LAN, set your own rules, and let the chaos loose. This is a game for game nights, full lobbies, and friends screaming at each other, no AI can replicate the moment you knock your best mate into the deep fryer at the last second. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎙️ <strong>NARRATED BY 'CHEF'</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Pretentious. Artistic. Deranged. French.</i></strong><i> </i>Every match comes with running commentary from the maddest chef in the business. <i>'Chef' is l'artiste,</i> a culinary king and the deranged owner of the deadliest kitchen on Earth. His menu's flavour of the day? Death. His crabs brawl in a kitchen colosseum where winners return to the tank… losers become his next famous dish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📷<strong>SCAN TO JOIN OUR DISCORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/e5364dda28ef88ecb9dca7d3dd451bec.avif?t=1787652860\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access is community-driven</strong>, expect game modes, new arenas, crabtastic content and more. Join our discord and be part of Crabs... a <strong>Multiplayer party brawler</strong> that's finger snapping fun!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to &quot;House of Crab.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crabs: Chef's Story</strong> is a 2–8 player PvP brawler that plays like a couch party game, but is built for online or LAN play. Grab your crew, pick your crab, and brawl across a kitchen full of deadly hazards in quick 2–7 minute rounds. Best with friends, open to anyone. Easy to 