ic. Deranged. French.</i></strong><i> </i>Every match comes with running commentary from the maddest chef in the business. <i>'Chef' is l'artiste,</i> a culinary king and the deranged owner of the deadliest kitchen on Earth. His menu's flavour of the day? Death. His crabs brawl in a kitchen colosseum where winners return to the tank… losers become his next famous dish.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📷<strong>SCAN TO JOIN OUR DISCORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/extras/e5364dda28ef88ecb9dca7d3dd451bec.avif?t=1787652860\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Access is community-driven</strong>, expect game modes, new arenas, crabtastic content and more. Join our discord and be part of Crabs... a <strong>Multiplayer party brawler</strong> that's finger snapping fun!</p>", "short_description": "'Couch Party Style' PvP chaos, online or LAN! Grab 2–8 friends and brawl in a deranged French chef's kitchen Colosseum. Best with your crew, but a blast with anyone. Master 'Crab-Fu', smash shells and become the crustacean champion. Winners return to the tank, losers become the dish of the day.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/ada7d0f78472edc5bb0c8b38d5ad67ba4d10718e/header.jpg?t=1787652860", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/0f12129a26c64087b999ac9fd9d6f85fca537eca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787652860", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1926880/0f12129a26c64087b999ac9fd9d6f85fca537eca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787652860", "website": "http://3guns.co.uk", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><